{"agent_id":"pp3g-yKAt-adversarial-review-of-the-135-unified-agent-lifecycle","agent_seq":3,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T04:46:17.676880701Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"92a47d4f-4b7d-4dbc-975a-25991ca1746b","comment_uuid":"aa3f52f3-2e0d-49c6-85bc-68888a675faa","author":"pp3g-yKAt-adversarial-review-of-the-135-unified-agent-lifecycle","content":"Plan: Adversarial review of #135's watcher plan. Read #135 (incl. TWO-TIER RECOVERY DESIGN comment), research #133/#134, related #115/#123. Verified claims against the live system: (a) crosslink launch.rs built-in watchdog (tmux-send-keys nudge, default-enabled, live in ps for this session) and its exit-condition defect; (b) .kickoff-status lifecycle (LAUNCHING->RUNNING->DONE; stale RUNNING after timeout-kill) + .kickoff-metadata.json (started_at, timeout_secs); (c) heartbeat.py + .crosslink/.cache/last-heartbeat as liveness signal; (d) installed claude is a wrapper translating to 'opencode run' — all kickoff agents run opencode; (e) opencode 1.18.11 provider config schema supports timeout/headerTimeout/chunkTimeout and none are configured; (f) playbook rules 5.3/5.4/6.1/7/8/13 + two-repo sync requirement. Evaluate the 5 requested points; post ONE --kind result verdict.","created_at":"2026-08-03T04:46:17.669985618Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:JRwxokEUeKPtJrC2z3PyixJ6AJU5S6Hvc9jslQp4W0Q","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgJfwSG2am+Fg3k1Aj3sFSOt1nVE4gWVKSZS2lcafpOa8AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAt1PvHKB9JFG5M3cKHFcBhBoYNOHZTC4HFP79yQWK1jxihoA17951VWJaXgaQ81benNRmQn9pRgFaEtlq5j9lCA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:JRwxokEUeKPtJrC2z3PyixJ6AJU5S6Hvc9jslQp4W0Q","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgJfwSG2am+Fg3k1Aj3sFSOt1nVE4gWVKSZS2lcafpOa8AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIESBvXHhCxWSDOCKIII+iAW6TCjvOiyKyH4fort+RN2B/j2GJrtGvgveHB7dfu7pajK7xzU06rAGrQHozA/iwg="}
